window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Emma has been given a quest by the gods to save her country from destruction. If she’s to preserve the future of the fae, she’ll have to become the strongest sorceress that’s ever lived, bring down the cult that seeks her power, and defeat the dark lord that threatens to rule over the kingdom.</p> <p>Ethan has joined the revolution to save Malovia, but the evil monarchs that control the nation have cast a shadow over all shifters and their fated mates. As a movement burns throughout the city, Ethan is tried for treason, and deception is unleashed as they seek the most powerful faerie objects of all time.</p> <p>Chaos is paramount as citizens battle against oppression. Emma and Ethan will either rise to reign over the fae, or bring about their final end.</p>"; 
